menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_MOTION_CONTROL
    bool "Enable motor, servo and action control"
    default n
    help
        Drives bounded motor and servo channels, plays walk, dance, tail and
        gesture actions, and enforces the guardian's speed, runtime and
        locomotion envelope. Every accepted command is clamped and an action
        stops on timeout, explicit stop or a lost link, so a device without a
        moving body never links the component.

endmenu
